<!DOCTYPE html><!--lCiBUgiT3DSF44Eeb9niT--><html lang="en"><head><meta charSet="utf-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"/><link rel="preload" as="image" href="/assets/DS Jobby Logo .png"/><link rel="preload" as="image" href="/assets/DS Jobby Logo (White).png"/><link rel="preload" as="image" href="/assets/hero.png"/><link rel="preload" as="image" href="/assets/talent_bridge_asset.png"/><link rel="preload" as="image" href="/assets/dyashin_logo.webp"/><link rel="preload" as="image" href="/assets/dsedify_logo.webp"/><link rel="stylesheet" href="/_next/static/css/62871bc18458c6b2.css" data-precedence="next"/><link rel="preload" as="script" fetchPriority="low" href="/_next/static/chunks/webpack-74c939c87fa0092a.js"/><script src="/_next/static/chunks/4bd1b696-c023c6e3521b1417.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/255-cf15ac3efcf391d6.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/main-app-d610a780c2137edd.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/619-ba102abea3e3d0e4.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/918-cba26ebe6eb5a241.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/app/layout-efd8b1857fa3c0f4.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/app/not-found-f2189fd79d35a3b9.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/app/page-19d2228b8c063522.js" async=""></script><link rel="preload" href="https://www.gstatic.com/firebasejs/12.14.0/firebase-app-compat.js" as="script"/><link rel="preload" href="https://www.gstatic.com/firebasejs/12.14.0/firebase-analytics-compat.js" as="script"/><meta name="google-site-verification" content="KwAAyK0UBJo6ZmuvtzV9mSzNZoUs2VTQP71EMZHcty8"/><title>DSJobby | Permanent Full-Time Staffing Agency</title><meta name="description" content="DSJobby is the premier talent acquisition partner for full-time permanent staffing, helping companies resolve hiring bottlenecks with pre-screened, verified profiles."/><meta name="author" content="DSJobby - A Unit of Dyashin Technosoft"/><meta name="keywords" content="permanent staffing,full-time hiring,placement agency,recruitment consultant,talent acquisition,DSJobby,Bengaluru staffing,pre-screened candidates,hiring solutions India"/><meta name="robots" content="index, follow"/><meta name="theme-color" content="#0B213E"/><link rel="canonical" href="https://dsjobby.com"/><meta name="google-site-verification" content="KwAAyK0UBJo6ZmuvtzV9mSzNZoUs2VTQP71EMZHcty8"/><meta property="og:title" content="DSJobby | Permanent Full-Time Staffing Agency"/><meta property="og:description" content="DSJobby is the premier talent acquisition partner for full-time permanent staffing, helping companies resolve hiring bottlenecks with pre-screened, verified profiles."/><meta property="og:url" content="https://dsjobby.com"/><meta property="og:site_name" content="DSJobby"/><meta property="og:locale" content="en_US"/><meta property="og:image" content="https://dsjobby.com/assets/logo.webp"/><meta property="og:image:width" content="1200"/><meta property="og:image:height" content="630"/><meta property="og:image:alt" content="DSJobby - Permanent Full-Time Staffing Agency"/><meta property="og:type" content="website"/><meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image"/><meta name="twitter:site" content="@DSJobby"/><meta name="twitter:title" content="DSJobby | Permanent Full-Time Staffing Agency"/><meta name="twitter:description" content="DSJobby is the premier talent acquisition partner for full-time permanent staffing, helping companies resolve hiring bottlenecks with pre-screened, verified profiles."/><meta name="twitter:image" content="https://dsjobby.com/assets/logo.webp"/><meta name="twitter:image:alt" content="DSJobby Logo"/><link rel="icon" href="/assets/favicon.ico"/><script src="/_next/static/chunks/polyfills-42372ed130431b0a.js" noModule=""></script></head><body><div hidden=""><!--$--><!--/$--></div><noscript><iframe src="https://www.googletagmanager.com/ns.html?id=GTM-NBQKRRV6" height="0" width="0" style="display:none;visibility:hidden"></iframe></noscript><header id="main-header" class="scrolled"><div class="container"><a class="logo-wrapper" id="header-logo-link" href="/#hero"><img src="/assets/DS Jobby Logo .png" alt="DSJobby Logo" id="logo-img"/></a><button class="menu-toggle " aria-label="Toggle Menu" id="menu-toggle-btn"><span></span><span></span><span></span></button><nav id="navbar" class=""><ul id="nav-list"><li><a id="nav-home" class="active" href="/#hero">Home</a></li><li><a class="" id="nav-about" href="/about">About Us</a></li><li><a id="nav-ind" class="" href="/#industries">Industries Served</a></li><li><a id="nav-net" class="" href="/#network">Our Network</a></li><li><a id="nav-test" class="" href="/#testimonials">Testimonials</a></li></ul><div class="nav-ctas" id="header-ctas"><a class="btn btn-primary-orange" id="header-jobseekers-cta" href="/job-seekers">For Job Seekers</a><button class="btn btn-primary-blue" id="header-recruiter-cta">Hire Talent</button></div></nav></div></header><main><script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Organization","name":"DSJobby","url":"https://dsjobby.com","logo":"https://dsjobby.com/assets/logo.webp","description":"DSJobby is a leading placement consulting agency specialized strictly in full-time permanent staffing solutions for employers.","sameAs":["https://www.facebook.com/DSJobby","https://x.com/DSJobby","https://www.linkedin.com/company/dsjobby","https://www.instagram.com/dsjobby/"],"parentOrganization":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Dyashin Technosoft","url":"https://dyashin.com"},"contactPoint":{"@type":"ContactPoint","telephone":"+91-93641-18452","contactType":"customer service","email":"info@dsjobby.com","areaServed":"IN","availableLanguage":["English","Hindi","Kannada"]},"address":{"@type":"PostalAddress","streetAddress":"#3203, 1st Floor, Anugraha Layout, Konanakunte Road, JP Nagar","addressLocality":"Bengaluru","addressRegion":"Karnataka","postalCode":"560078","addressCountry":"IN"}}</script><script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Service","serviceType":"Permanent Staffing and Placement Consultation","provider":{"@type":"LocalBusiness","name":"DSJobby","image":"https://dsjobby.com/assets/logo.webp","address":{"@type":"PostalAddress","streetAddress":"#3203, 1st Floor, Anugraha Layout, Konanakunte Road, JP Nagar","addressLocality":"Bengaluru","addressRegion":"Karnataka","postalCode":"560078","addressCountry":"IN"}},"areaServed":"IN","description":"Exclusively full-time permanent staffing and talent acquisition solutions with AI-powered JD matching, screening and onboarding validation."}</script><section class="hero" id="hero"><div class="hero-glow glow-blue"></div><div class="hero-glow glow-orange"></div><div class="container"><div class="hero-grid"><div class="hero-content"><h1>Everything You Need to <br/><span class="gradient-text-blue">Hire Smart</span></h1><p>DSJobby is a trusted talent acquisition partner specializing in full-time permanent staffing solutions. We support organizations facing challenges in closing critical hiring needs by sourcing, screening, and delivering qualified professionals across diverse domains and industries.</p><div class="hero-badge-container"><div class="hero-badge"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2.5" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m6 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"></path></svg>10,000+ Talents Placed</div><div class="hero-badge"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2.5" d="M17 20h5v-2a3 3 0 00-5.356-1.857M17 20H7m10 0v-2c0-.656-.126-1.283-.356-1.857M7 20H2v-2a3 3 0 015.356-1.857M7 20v-2c0-.656.126-1.283.356-1.857m0 0a5.002 5.002 0 019.288 0M15 7a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0zm6 3a2 2 0 11-4 0 2 2 0 014 0zM7 10a2 2 0 11-4 0 2 2 0 014 0z"></path></svg>300+ Active Clients</div><div class="hero-badge"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2.5" d="M13 7h8m0 0v8m0-8l-8 8-4-4-6 6"></path></svg>95% Placement Success Rate</div></div><div class="hero-actions"><button class="btn btn-primary-blue" id="hero-recruiter-btn">Consult for Talent</button><a class="btn btn-outline" id="hero-jobseekers-btn" href="/job-seekers">For Job Seekers</a></div></div><div class="hero-image-wrapper"><div class="hero-image-container"><img src="/assets/hero.png" alt="DSJobby Professional Recruitment Partners" id="hero-main-img"/></div></div></div></div></section><section class="section-padding job-seeker-perspective" id="for-job-seekers" style="background-color:var(--bg-light);border-bottom:1px solid var(--border-light)"><div class="container"><div class="section-header"><span class="exclusivity-tag" style="background-color:rgba(242, 141, 33, 0.1);color:var(--primary-orange);border-color:rgba(242, 141, 33, 0.2)">For Job Seekers</span><h2>Your Career Growth Starts Here</h2><p>Whether you&#x27;re a fresher or an experienced professional, DSJobby connects you with permanent full-time roles at top companies — completely free of cost.</p></div><div class="seeker-cards-grid"><div class="seeker-card"><div class="seeker-card-icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 7h8m0 0v8m0-8l-8 8-4-4-6 6"></path></svg></div><h3>Accelerate Your Career</h3><p>Access exclusive full-time permanent job opportunities at leading companies across IT, Engineering, Finance, Healthcare, and more. No contract or freelance roles — only stable, long-term careers.</p><ul class="why-bullet-list" style="margin-top:auto"><li><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z" clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg>Roles at 300+ hiring companies</li><li><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z" clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg>From freshers to senior professionals</li></ul></div><div class="seeker-card seeker-card-highlight"><div class="seeker-card-icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 3v2m6-2v2M9 19v2m6-2v2M5 9H3m2 6H3m18-6h-2m2 6h-2M7 5h10a2 2 0 012 2v10a2 2 0 01-2 2H7a2 2 0 01-2-2V7a2 2 0 012-2z"></path></svg></div><h3>AI-Powered Job Matching</h3><p>Upload your resume once, and our AI platform automatically matches your skills and experience with the best-fit job opportunities from our active hiring mandates.</p><ul class="why-bullet-list" style="margin-top:auto"><li><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z" clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg>Smart JD-to-resume matching</li><li><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z" clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg>Get notified for new matching roles</li></ul></div><div class="seeker-card"><div class="seeker-card-icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M18.364 5.636l-3.536 3.536m0 5.656l3.536 3.536M9.172 9.172L5.636 5.636m3.536 9.192l-3.536 3.536M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0zm-5 0a4 4 0 11-8 0 4 4 0 018 0z"></path></svg></div><h3>Free Career Support</h3><p>Get expert guidance from our recruitment leads — from resume reviews and interview preparation tips to career path counseling. All completely free for candidates.</p><ul class="why-bullet-list" style="margin-top:auto"><li><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z" clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg>Mock interviews &amp; resume reviews</li><li><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z" clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg>Zero cost — always free for candidates</li></ul></div></div><div class="seeker-cta-bar"><div class="seeker-cta-content"><h3>Ready to Take the Next Step in Your Career?</h3><p>Browse active job openings, upload your resume, or request career guidance — all in one place.</p></div><a class="btn btn-primary-orange" id="home-seeker-cta-btn" href="/job-seekers">Explore Opportunities<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" style="width:18px;height:18px;margin-left:0.5rem"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2.5" d="M13.5 4.5L21 12m0 0l-7.5 7.5M21 12H3"></path></svg></a></div></div></section><section class="section-padding talent-bridge-section" id="talent-bridge"><div class="container"><div class="section-header"><span class="exclusivity-tag" style="background-color:rgba(27, 154, 214, 0.1);color:var(--primary-blue);border-color:rgba(27, 154, 214, 0.2)">The Talent Bridge</span><h2>Bridging the Gap: Job Seekers &amp; Employers</h2><p>DSJobby acts as the ultimate digital catalyst, aligning qualified professionals with top-tier organizations in a seamless, high-velocity matching ecosystem.</p></div><div class="bridge-interactive-container"><div class="bridge-svg-background"><svg viewBox="0 0 1000 400" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M 100,200 Q 300,50 500,200" stroke="url(#blue-orange-grad)" stroke-width="3" stroke-dasharray="8 6" class="bridge-flow-line flow-left"></path><path d="M 900,200 Q 700,50 500,200" stroke="url(#orange-blue-grad)" stroke-width="3" stroke-dasharray="8 6" class="bridge-flow-line flow-right"></path><defs><linearGradient id="blue-orange-grad" x1="0%" y1="0%" x2="100%" y2="0%"><stop offset="0%" stop-color="var(--primary-blue)"></stop><stop offset="100%" stop-color="var(--primary-orange)"></stop></linearGradient><linearGradient id="orange-blue-grad" x1="0%" y1="0%" x2="100%" y2="0%"><stop offset="0%" stop-color="var(--primary-orange)"></stop><stop offset="100%" stop-color="var(--primary-blue)"></stop></linearGradient></defs></svg></div><div class="bridge-glow glow-blue-left"></div><div class="bridge-glow glow-orange-right"></div><div class="bridge-panel seekers-panel"><div class="panel-badge blue-badge">For Job Seekers</div><div class="panel-header"><h3>Empowering Careers</h3><p>We connect talented candidates with stable, permanent growth opportunities, completely free of charge.</p></div><div class="panel-items"><div class="panel-item"><span class="item-icon">🚀</span><div><h4>100% Permanent Roles</h4><p>Direct placement in stable, long-term full-time careers at growing firms.</p></div></div><div class="panel-item"><span class="item-icon">🧠</span><div><h4>AI-Powered Matching</h4><p>Smart resume matching connects your skills directly to open requirements.</p></div></div><div class="panel-item"><span class="item-icon">🎓</span><div><h4>Free Professional Prep</h4><p>Access to resume reviews, mock interviews, and mentoring from experts.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="bridge-pillar"><div class="bridge-graphic-wrapper"><img src="/assets/talent_bridge_asset.png" alt="Futuristic Talent Bridge" class="bridge-core-img"/></div><div class="bridge-core-badge"><span>AI Connection Engine</span></div><div class="bridge-stats-summary"><div class="b-stat"><strong>50k+</strong><span>Vetted Profiles</span></div><div class="b-stat"><strong>300+</strong><span>Hiring Partners</span></div><div class="b-stat"><strong>95%</strong><span>Success Rate</span></div></div></div><div class="bridge-panel employers-panel"><div class="panel-badge orange-badge">For Employers</div><div class="panel-header"><h3>Accelerating Hiring</h3><p>We resolve candidate sourcing bottlenecks by delivering pre-screened, verified profiles within 24 hours.</p></div><div class="panel-items"><div class="panel-item"><span class="item-icon">⚡</span><div><h4>Rapid Sourcing</h4><p>Bypass bandwidth constraints and close roles with immediate hiring turnarounds.</p></div></div><div class="panel-item"><span class="item-icon">🔍</span><div><h4>Rigorous Pre-Screening</h4><p>Profiles are mock-tested and verified so you only interview top matches.</p></div></div><div class="panel-item"><span class="item-icon">🛡️</span><div><h4>Risk-Free Compliance</h4><p>Optional full BGV background checks backed by a placement replacement guarantee.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="section-padding platform-section" id="platform" style="border-bottom:1px solid var(--border-light)"><div class="container"><div class="section-header"><span class="exclusivity-tag" style="background-color:rgba(27, 154, 214, 0.1);color:var(--primary-blue);border-color:rgba(27, 154, 214, 0.2)">AI-Driven Recruitment</span><h2>About Our Placement Platform</h2><p>DSJobby, the placement solutions subsidiary of Dyashin, is powered by an AI-enabled recruitment platform designed to simplify and accelerate hiring. Backed by a pool of 50,000+ verified and pre-screened candidates, we help organizations identify the right talent faster through relevant JD matching and comprehensive end-to-end placement support.</p></div><div class="platform-grid"><div class="platform-cards-grid"><div class="platform-feat-card"><span class="platform-number">01</span><h3>Verified &amp; Readily Available Talent Pool</h3><p>We maintain a pre-screened pool of candidates who are actively and eagerly looking for job opportunities, ready to join immediately.</p></div><div class="platform-feat-card"><span class="platform-number">02</span><h3>Tech and Non-Tech Hiring</h3><p>From technology and operations to sales, finance, and support functions, our talent network covers a diverse range of technical and non-technical roles across industries.</p></div><div class="platform-feat-card"><span class="platform-number">03</span><h3>AI-Powered Hiring Platform</h3><p>Candidates subscribe to our AI-driven platform, undergo basic background checks and pre-screening, ensuring genuine, job-ready talent.</p></div><div class="platform-feat-card"><span class="platform-number">04</span><h3>Freshers Hiring Across Streams</h3><p>We maintain a strong pool of pre-screened freshers and entry-level candidates who are actively seeking career opportunities and are available for immediate joining.</p></div></div><div class="platform-sidebar"><h3>Recruitment Platform Highlights</h3><div class="platform-checklist"><div class="platform-check-item"><div class="platform-check-icon">✓</div><div class="platform-check-text"><strong>Verified Profiles</strong><span>Background-checked and verified candidates.</span></div></div><div class="platform-check-item"><div class="platform-check-icon">✓</div><div class="platform-check-text"><strong>Pre-Screened Talent</strong><span>Mock-tested and ready candidates.</span></div></div><div class="platform-check-item"><div class="platform-check-icon">✓</div><div class="platform-check-text"><strong>AI JD Matching</strong><span>Smart auto-shortlisting systems.</span></div></div><div class="platform-check-item"><div class="platform-check-icon">✓</div><div class="platform-check-text"><strong>Built-in ATS</strong><span>Full hiring visibility for our partners.</span></div></div><div class="platform-check-item"><div class="platform-check-icon">✓</div><div class="platform-check-text"><strong>Faster Hiring</strong><span>Quick turnaround on all open roles.</span></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="section-padding" id="industries" style="background-color:var(--bg-light);border-top:1px solid var(--border-light)"><div class="container"><div class="section-header"><h2>Industries &amp; Domains We Serve</h2><p>Our staffing solutions are industry-agnostic, enabling us to deliver high-quality permanent talent across diverse sectors through our extensive multi-industry partner network.</p></div><div class="industries-grid" id="industries-grid"><div class="network-detail-card" style="padding:2rem"><div class="network-detail-icon" style="font-size:1.75rem">💻</div><div class="network-detail-info"><h4 style="font-size:1.25rem;margin-bottom:0.25rem">IT &amp; Software Development</h4><p>Full stack engineers, Cloud architects, Cyber-security experts, and Data scientists.</p></div></div><div class="network-detail-card" style="padding:2rem"><div class="network-detail-icon" style="font-size:1.75rem">⚡</div><div class="network-detail-info"><h4 style="font-size:1.25rem;margin-bottom:0.25rem">Embedded &amp; Semiconductor</h4><p>Microcontrollers, RTOS, VLSI design, firmware development, and hardware systems.</p></div></div><div class="network-detail-card" style="padding:2rem"><div class="network-detail-icon" style="font-size:1.75rem">📊</div><div class="network-detail-info"><h4 style="font-size:1.25rem;margin-bottom:0.25rem">SAP Consultants</h4><p>SAP ABAP, FICO, MM, SD, HANA, and corporate enterprise resource planning integrations.</p></div></div><div class="network-detail-card" style="padding:2rem"><div class="network-detail-icon" style="font-size:1.75rem">🏢</div><div class="network-detail-info"><h4 style="font-size:1.25rem;margin-bottom:0.25rem">Engineering &amp; Manufacturing</h4><p>Industrial engineers, Project supervisors, QA specialists, and Operations directors.</p></div></div><div class="network-detail-card" style="padding:2rem"><div class="network-detail-icon" style="font-size:1.75rem">💲</div><div class="network-detail-info"><h4 style="font-size:1.25rem;margin-bottom:0.25rem">Finance &amp; Banking</h4><p>Investment analysts, Certified accountants, Risk officers, and Wealth managers.</p></div></div><div class="network-detail-card" style="padding:2rem"><div class="network-detail-icon" style="font-size:1.75rem">🩸</div><div class="network-detail-info"><h4 style="font-size:1.25rem;margin-bottom:0.25rem">Healthcare &amp; Life Sciences</h4><p>Clinical researchers, Laboratory directors, Medical representatives, and Admin managers.</p></div></div><div class="network-detail-card" style="padding:2rem"><div class="network-detail-icon" style="font-size:1.75rem">📢</div><div class="network-detail-info"><h4 style="font-size:1.25rem;margin-bottom:0.25rem">Sales, Marketing &amp; PR</h4><p>Brand managers, Account executives, Digital specialists, and PR coordinators.</p></div></div><div class="network-detail-card" style="padding:2rem"><div class="network-detail-icon" style="font-size:1.75rem">📦</div><div class="network-detail-info"><h4 style="font-size:1.25rem;margin-bottom:0.25rem">Logistics &amp; Supply Chain</h4><p>Procurement heads, Logistics coordinators, Operations leads, and Warehouse managers.</p></div></div><div class="network-detail-card" style="padding:2rem"><div class="network-detail-icon" style="font-size:1.75rem">👥</div><div class="network-detail-info"><h4 style="font-size:1.25rem;margin-bottom:0.25rem">Human Resources &amp; Admin</h4><p>Talent acquisition partners, HR managers, Administrative heads, and Executives.</p></div></div><div class="network-detail-card" style="padding:2rem"><div class="network-detail-icon" style="font-size:1.75rem">🛒</div><div class="network-detail-info"><h4 style="font-size:1.25rem;margin-bottom:0.25rem">Retail &amp; E-Commerce</h4><p>Product managers, Supply chain analysts, Visual merchandisers, and Store directors.</p></div></div><div class="network-detail-card" style="padding:2rem"><div class="network-detail-icon" style="font-size:1.75rem">🛡️</div><div class="network-detail-info"><h4 style="font-size:1.25rem;margin-bottom:0.25rem">Defense &amp; Aerospace</h4><p>Defense technology specialists, avionics software engineers, systems validators, and safety-critical developers.</p></div></div><div class="network-detail-card" style="padding:2rem"><div class="network-detail-icon" style="font-size:1.75rem;background:rgba(242, 141, 33, 0.08);color:var(--primary-orange)">✨</div><div class="network-detail-info"><h4 style="font-size:1.25rem;margin-bottom:0.25rem">All Other Domains</h4><p>We actively service niche and custom sectors based on your business requirements.</p></div></div></div><div class="industries-banner"><h3>Serving All Sectors</h3><p>No matter how niche or specialized your industry is, our extensive recruitment network enables us to source, assess, and deliver high-quality full-time professionals who are ready to integrate seamlessly into your organization.</p></div></div></section><section class="section-padding stats" id="network"><div class="container"><div class="section-header"><h2>Our Growing Network</h2><p>Connecting verified corporate entities with qualified job-ready candidates to build cohesive and powerful ecosystems.</p></div><div class="stats-grid"><div class="stat-card" id="stat-card-companies"><div class="stat-icon">💼</div><div class="stat-number"><span>0<!-- -->+</span></div><div class="stat-label">Hiring Companies</div><p class="stat-desc">Leading multinationals and scaling innovators trust our selections.</p></div><div class="stat-card" id="stat-card-allies"><div class="stat-icon">🤝</div><div class="stat-number"><span>0<!-- -->+</span></div><div class="stat-label">Business Allies</div><p class="stat-desc">Collaborative ecosystems reinforcing candidate screening reach.</p></div><div class="stat-card" id="stat-card-sectors"><div class="stat-icon">🏭</div><div class="stat-number"><span>0<!-- -->+</span></div><div class="stat-label">Industry Sectors</div><p class="stat-desc">Functional domains from IT, Health, Finance, to Engineering.</p></div></div><div class="network-details" id="network-details-grid"><div class="network-detail-card"><div class="network-detail-icon">🎓</div><div class="network-detail-info"><h4><span>0<!-- -->+</span></h4><p>Fresh Graduates Placed</p></div></div><div class="network-detail-card"><div class="network-detail-icon">👤</div><div class="network-detail-info"><h4><span>0<!-- -->+</span></h4><p>Active Candidate Pipelines</p></div></div><div class="network-detail-card"><div class="network-detail-icon">✍</div><div class="network-detail-info"><h4><span>0<!-- -->+</span></h4><p>Job-Ready Profiles Weekly</p></div></div></div></div></section><section class="section-padding why-choose-us" id="why-us"><div class="container"><div class="section-header"><h2>Why Partner With Us?</h2><p style="max-width:800px;margin:0 auto">With more than 10 years of industry experience, we have built a strong reputation as a trusted recruitment and talent acquisition partner. Backed by an extensive professional network and deep market expertise, we help organizations across industries connect with high-quality talent efficiently and effectively.</p></div><div class="why-grid" id="why-choose-grid"><div class="why-card"><div class="why-img-container"><svg viewBox="0 0 500 240" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" style="background:#F1F5F9;width:100%;height:100%"><rect x="175" y="45" width="150" height="35" rx="10" fill="rgba(27, 154, 214, 0.1)" stroke="#1B9AD6" stroke-width="4"></rect><rect x="175" y="95" width="150" height="35" rx="10" fill="rgba(27, 154, 214, 0.1)" stroke="#1B9AD6" stroke-width="4"></rect><rect x="175" y="145" width="150" height="35" rx="10" fill="rgba(27, 154, 214, 0.1)" stroke="#1B9AD6" stroke-width="4"></rect><circle cx="205" cy="62" r="5" fill="#F28D21"></circle><circle cx="205" cy="112" r="5" fill="#F28D21"></circle><circle cx="205" cy="162" r="5" fill="#F28D21"></circle><circle cx="250" cy="120" r="90" stroke="rgba(27, 154, 214, 0.2)" stroke-width="2" stroke-dasharray="5 5"></circle></svg></div><div class="why-card-content"><h3><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M4 7v10c0 2.21 3.582 4 8 4s8-1.79 8-4V7M4 7c0 2.21 3.582 4 8 4s8-1.79 8-4M4 7c0-2.21 3.582-4 8-4s8 1.79 8 4m0 5c0 2.21-3.582 4-8 4s-8-1.79-8-4"></path></svg>Vast Resume Database</h3><p>Instant access to a diverse pool of pre-screened candidates across both technical and non-technical domains.</p><ul class="why-bullet-list"><li><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z" clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg>Pre-screened active candidates ready for placement</li><li><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z" clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg>Spanning all primary technical &amp; operational sectors</li></ul></div></div><div class="why-card"><div class="why-img-container"><svg viewBox="0 0 500 240" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" style="background:#F1F5F9;width:100%;height:100%"><circle cx="250" cy="120" r="60" fill="rgba(242, 141, 33, 0.1)" stroke="#F28D21" stroke-width="4"></circle><circle cx="250" cy="120" r="25" fill="#1B9AD6"></circle><path d="M250 80 L250 160 M210 120 L290 120" stroke="#0B213E" stroke-width="4"></path><circle cx="250" cy="80" r="8" fill="#F28D21"></circle><circle cx="250" cy="160" r="8" fill="#F28D21"></circle><circle cx="210" cy="120" r="8" fill="#F28D21"></circle><circle cx="290" cy="120" r="8" fill="#F28D21"></circle><circle cx="250" cy="120" r="90" stroke="rgba(242, 141, 33, 0.2)" stroke-width="2" stroke-dasharray="5 5"></circle></svg></div><div class="why-card-content"><h3><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 3v2m6-2v2M9 19v2m6-2v2M5 9H3m2 6H3m18-6h-2m2 6h-2M7 5h10a2 2 0 012 2v10a2 2 0 01-2 2H7a2 2 0 01-2-2V7a2 2 0 012-2z"></path></svg>AI-Powered ATS Technology</h3><p>We utilize a proprietary, feature-rich Applicant Tracking System (ATS) driven by artificial intelligence to source, match, and deliver the most precise profiles quickly.</p><ul class="why-bullet-list"><li><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z" clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg>Smart automated job-description (JD) matching</li><li><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z" clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg>Real-time hiring pipelines &amp; visibility dashboard</li></ul></div></div><div class="why-card"><div class="why-img-container"><svg viewBox="0 0 500 240" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" style="background:#F1F5F9;width:100%;height:100%"><circle cx="250" cy="120" r="70" fill="rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.1)"></circle><path d="M200 120 L235 155 L300 85" stroke="#10B981" stroke-width="12" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><circle cx="250" cy="120" r="90" stroke="rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.3)" stroke-width="2" stroke-dasharray="5 5"></circle><path d="M160 120 L180 120 M320 120 L340 120" stroke="#10B981" stroke-width="4"></path></svg></div><div class="why-card-content"><h3><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m5.618-4.016A11.955 11.955 0 0112 2.944a11.955 11.955 0 01-8.618 3.04A12.02 12.02 0 003 9c0 5.591 3.824 10.29 9 11.622 5.176-1.332 9-6.03 9-11.622 0-1.042-.133-2.052-.382-3.016z"></path></svg>Risk-Free Hiring</h3><p>To ensure compliance and peace of mind, we offer optional, comprehensive Background Verification (BGV) services to secure vetted, high-integrity candidates.</p><ul class="why-bullet-list"><li><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z" clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg>Optional comprehensive BGV &amp; reference screening</li><li><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z" clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg>Secure permanent staffing replacement guarantee</li></ul></div></div></div></div></section><section class="partners"><div class="container"><h4>Trusted Partners &amp; Companies We Work With</h4><div class="partners-marquee-container" id="marquee-partner-container"><div class="partners-marquee-track" style="animation-d