<img src="/assets/clients/veniura-company-logo.webp" alt="veniura company logo" loading="lazy" style="max-height:100%;max-width:140px;object-fit:contain"/></div><div class="partners-logo"><img src="/assets/clients/venturbiz-company-logo.webp" alt="venturbiz company logo" loading="lazy" style="max-height:100%;max-width:140px;object-fit:contain"/></div><div class="partners-logo"><img src="/assets/clients/walkingtree-company-logo.webp" alt="walkingtree company logo" loading="lazy" style="max-height:100%;max-width:140px;object-fit:contain"/></div><div class="partners-logo"><img src="/assets/clients/wt-company-logo.webp" alt="wt company logo" loading="lazy" style="max-height:100%;max-width:140px;object-fit:contain"/></div><div class="partners-logo"><img src="/assets/clients/zucitech-company-logo.webp" alt="zucitech company logo" loading="lazy" style="max-height:100%;max-width:140px;object-fit:contain"/></div></div></div></div></section><section class="section-padding corporate-group-section" id="group-companies"><div class="container"><div class="section-header"><span class="exclusivity-tag" style="background-color:rgba(242, 141, 33, 0.15);color:var(--primary-orange);border-color:rgba(242, 141, 33, 0.3)">Our Group Family</span><h2>The Dyashin Group Companies</h2><p>We work in perfect digital alignment to help corporate clients hire, train, upskill, and scale software/engineering resources.</p></div><div class="group-grid"><div class="group-card"><div class="group-card-logo-area"><img src="/assets/dyashin_logo.webp" alt="Dyashin Technosoft Logo" style="height:40px;width:auto"/></div><h3>Dyashin Technosoft</h3><p>Our parent corporation. A premier IT and Engineering services company, offering custom software development, digital transformation, managed project services, and solution accelerators.</p><a href="https://dyashin.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="group-card-link">Visit Website<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M13.5 4.5L21 12m0 0l-7.5 7.5M21 12H3"></path></svg></a></div><div class="group-card" style="border:1px solid rgba(27, 154, 214, 0.3);background-color:rgba(27, 154, 214, 0.05)"><div class="group-card-logo-area"><img src="/assets/DS Jobby Logo (White).png" alt="DSJobby Logo" style="height:40px;width:auto"/></div><h3>DSJobby</h3><p>Our specialized recruitment and talent placement arm. Focusing exclusively on full-time permanent staffing solutions and placement consulting across all corporate scales.</p><a href="#hero" class="group-card-link" style="color:var(--primary-orange)">Active Services (Current Page)<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M13.5 4.5L21 12m0 0l-7.5 7.5M21 12H3"></path></svg></a></div><div class="group-card"><div class="group-card-logo-area"><img src="/assets/dsedify_logo.webp" alt="DSEdify Logo" style="height:40px;width:auto"/></div><h3>DSEdify</h3><p>Our training and learning division. Providing zero-cost off-campus campus fresh graduate hiring, corporate workforce upskilling, and pre-assessed junior pipelines.</p><a href="https://dsedify.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="group-card-link">Visit Website<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M13.5 4.5L21 12m0 0l-7.5 7.5M21 12H3"></path></svg></a></div></div></div></section><section class="testimonials-section section-padding" id="testimonials"><div class="container"><div class="section-header"><span class="exclusivity-tag" style="background-color:rgba(27, 154, 214, 0.1);color:var(--primary-blue);border-color:rgba(27, 154, 214, 0.2)">Client Success</span><h2>What Partner Employers Say</h2><p>Read honest reviews from HR leaders and executives who rely on DSJobby for permanent full-time hiring.</p></div><div class="testimonials-carousel-container"><div class="testimonials-track" style="transform:translateX(-0%)"><div class="testimonial-slide"><div class="testimonial-card"><div class="quote-icon">“</div><blockquote class="testimonial-quote">DSJobby has completely transformed our recruiting pipeline. Their pre-screened talent pools helped us close 8 tech roles within two weeks.</blockquote><div class="testimonial-author"><strong>Sarah Jenkins</strong><span>VP of Talent Acquisition<!-- -->, <!-- -->Leading Digital Payment &amp; FinTech Corporation</span></div></div></div><div class="testimonial-slide"><div class="testimonial-card"><div class="quote-icon">“</div><blockquote class="testimonial-quote">The speed and quality of candidates from DSJobby are unmatched. Unlike other consultants, they only send highly matching, permanent-focused prospects.</blockquote><div class="testimonial-author"><strong>Amit Sharma</strong><span>Director of HR<!-- -->, <!-- -->Global Software Development &amp; Cloud Solutions Provider</span></div></div></div><div class="testimonial-slide"><div class="testimonial-card"><div class="quote-icon">“</div><blockquote class="testimonial-quote">Trust and transparency are core to DSJobby. Their relationship managers communicate clearly, making talent acquisition incredibly efficient.</blockquote><div class="testimonial-author"><strong>Helena Carter</strong><span>Chief Operations Officer<!-- -->, <!-- -->Pioneering Biotechnology &amp; Healthcare Research Firm</span></div></div></div><div class="testimonial-slide"><div class="testimonial-card"><div class="quote-icon">“</div><blockquote class="testimonial-quote">DSJobby understands niche industrial engineering roles perfectly. Their screening pipeline delivered vetted candidates who integrated into our manufacturing teams immediately.</blockquote><div class="testimonial-author"><strong>Marcus Miller</strong><span>VP of Engineering<!-- -->, <!-- -->World-leading Building Materials &amp; Construction Conglomerate</span></div></div></div><div class="testimonial-slide"><div class="testimonial-card"><div class="quote-icon">“</div><blockquote class="testimonial-quote">We faced massive hiring volume spikes. DSJobby acted as a seamless extended arm of our team, delivering high-integrity permanent hires without adding to our internal HR burden.</blockquote><div class="testimonial-author"><strong>Meera Nair</strong><span>Talent Acquisition Lead<!-- -->, <!-- -->Multinational Consumer Goods &amp; E-Commerce Retailer</span></div></div></div><div class="testimonial-slide"><div class="testimonial-card"><div class="quote-icon">“</div><blockquote class="testimonial-quote">Finding DO-178C compliant systems and safety engineers is incredibly tough. DSJobby&#x27;s embedded systems database yielded verified professionals who matched our exact compliance needs.</blockquote><div class="testimonial-author"><strong>David Wilson</strong><span>Head of Avionics &amp; Systems<!-- -->, <!-- -->Top-tier Aerospace &amp; Defense Technology Group</span></div></div></div><div class="testimonial-slide"><div class="testimonial-card"><div class="quote-icon">“</div><blockquote class="testimonial-quote">Sourcing certified SAP consultants who possess both deep technical capability and domain knowledge has always been a bottleneck. DSJobby delivered highly vetted functional and technical consultants who integrated seamlessly into our global ERP projects.</blockquote><div class="testimonial-author"><strong>Robert Chen</strong><span>SAP Delivery Director<!-- -->, <!-- -->Global Enterprise Resource Planning &amp; SAP Integration Consultancy</span></div></div></div><div class="testimonial-slide"><div class="testimonial-card"><div class="quote-icon">“</div><blockquote class="testimonial-quote">In logistics and supply chain operations, response times are critical. When we needed key warehouse operations and logistics planning leads, DSJobby understood our requirements perfectly and presented qualified candidates within days.</blockquote><div class="testimonial-author"><strong>Elena Rostova</strong><span>VP of Supply Chain<!-- -->, <!-- -->International Logistics &amp; Supply Chain Solutions Enterprise</span></div></div></div><div class="testimonial-slide"><div class="testimonial-card"><div class="quote-icon">“</div><blockquote class="testimonial-quote">Finding senior hardware designers and VLSI verification specialists is incredibly competitive. DSJobby&#x27;s embedded systems pipeline gave us access to verified professionals who had the precise skillset required for our chip design cycles.</blockquote><div class="testimonial-author"><strong>Sanjay Krishnan</strong><span>Director of Silicon Engineering<!-- -->, <!-- -->Silicon Valley-based Semiconductor Design &amp; VLSI Systems Corporation</span></div></div></div><div class="testimonial-slide"><div class="testimonial-card"><div class="quote-icon">“</div><blockquote class="testimonial-quote">Hiring compliance and wealth management officers demands high integrity and rigorous screening. DSJobby&#x27;s optional background checks and pre-screening process gave our executive leadership team complete peace of mind.</blockquote><div class="testimonial-author"><strong>Patricia Vance</strong><span>Chief Compliance Officer<!-- -->, <!-- -->Leading Multinational Investment Banking &amp; Wealth Management Institution</span></div></div></div></div><div class="carousel-controls"><div class="carousel-dot active" role="button" tabindex="0" aria-label="Go to testimonial 1 of 10"></div><div class="carousel-dot " role="button" tabindex="0" aria-label="Go to testimonial 2 of 10"></div><div class="carousel-dot " role="button" tabindex="0" aria-label="Go to testimonial 3 of 10"></div><div class="carousel-dot " role="button" tabindex="0" aria-label="Go to testimonial 4 of 10"></div><div class="carousel-dot " role="button" tabindex="0" aria-label="Go to testimonial 5 of 10"></div><div class="carousel-dot " role="button" tabindex="0" aria-label="Go to testimonial 6 of 10"></div><div class="carousel-dot " role="button" tabindex="0" aria-label="Go to testimonial 7 of 10"></div><div class="carousel-dot " role="button" tabindex="0" aria-label="Go to testimonial 8 of 10"></div><div class="carousel-dot " role="button" tabindex="0" aria-label="Go to testimonial 9 of 10"></div><div class="carousel-dot " role="button" tabindex="0" aria-label="Go to testimonial 10 of 10"></div></div></div></div></section><section class="section-padding portal-cta" id="portal"><div class="container"><div class="portal-box recruiter-box portal-box-full" id="portal-box-recruiters"><div class="portal-box-icon">💼</div><h3>Need to Resolve Your Hiring Bottlenecks?</h3><p>Partner with DSJobby today. Let our dedicated consultants manage your candidate sourcing, rigorous evaluations, and full-time placement mandates across all domains and industries.</p><div class="portal-stats-row"><div class="portal-stat-badge"><strong class="gradient-text-orange">100%</strong><span>Permanent Staffing Focus</span></div><div class="portal-stat-badge"><strong class="gradient-text-blue">All Sectors</strong><span>Any Domain or Specialty</span></div><div class="portal-stat-badge"><strong style="color:var(--success)">Full Support</strong><span>Vetting &amp; Interview Mgmt</span></div></div><button class="btn btn-primary-orange" id="portal-recruiter-btn" style="min-width:250px;padding:1rem 2.5rem">Start Hiring Talents</button></div></div></section><!--$--><!--/$--></main><footer><div class="container"><div class="footer-grid"><div class="footer-brand"><a class="footer-logo" href="/#hero"><img src="/assets/DS Jobby Logo (White).png" alt="DSJobby Logo"/></a><p>DSJobby is a leading placement consulting agency specialized strictly in full-time permanent hires, building long-term talent bonds for businesses.</p><div class="social-links" id="footer-socials"><a href="https://www.facebook.com/DSJobby" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="s